## Why it no longer freezes

# The draw skip now also requires gInjectedGeneration == renderGeneration. Every rebuild
# (resize / world enter) bumps the generation; until one frame has really injected under
# the new generation the TAAU draw is NOT skipped. During the 2 s MV catch-up above the
# screen therefore stayed on TAAU (120 failed injection attempts), then the skip resumed
# at #3600. No crash, no D3D12 error, and the user reports no freeze/truncation/exposure.
